# Working in this repo

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) before you edit.
- One issue, one branch, one pull request. Roxana reviews and merges.
- The issue title starts with one emoji code. The pull request title is a plain sentence.
- Use the templates in `.github/`.
- Stay inside the current issue.
- Do not change how a workflow behaves unless the issue asks for that.
- Do not put secrets in any file or log. A workflow may name an n8n credential. It may not hold the key.
- Plain words. No em dashes.
